OL,3,AMan convicted of starting Palisades    
OL,4,Afire in Los Angeles                    
OL,6,FA jury in Los Angeles has found a      
OL,7,F30-year-old man guilty of starting one 
OL,8,Fof the most destructive wildfires in   
OL,9,FCalifornia's history.                  
OL,11,FJonathan Rinderknecht was convicted of 
OL,12,Farson after starting the fires that    
OL,13,Fswept through Pacific Palisades and    
OL,14,Fparts of Malibu in January last year,  
OL,15,Fkilling 12 people and destroying more  
OL,16,Fthan 6,800 buildings in the US state.  
OL,18,FThe conviction was handed down nearly  
OL,19,Ffive months after deadlocked jurors led
OL,20,Fto the judge declaring a mistrial.     
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
